# Optional. `make dev` reads this file after it is copied to .env.
# Shell environment variables take precedence. Paths are relative to repository root.
# Leave DATA_PACKAGE_PATH unset to list available separate processed packages.
# Explicitly choose one package to expose only that region:
# DATA_PACKAGE_PATH=data/processed/demo.json
# DATA_PACKAGE_PATH=data/processed/real.json

# Durable local SQLite investigation records; not included in source control.
TASKS_DB_PATH=data/verification.sqlite3

# No paid basemap key, cloud hosting account, or Earth Engine credentials required.
# Optional source ingestion is configured with CLI flags; see data/README.md.
